<div class="text guide-styles" data-units-dynamic="article" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">
<div class="markup-toc-wrapper">
<button class="markup-toc-button">Show Table of Contents</button></div>Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear List for Arcane Mage DPS in Cataclysm Classic Phase 4. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Twilight Protocol Dungeons and Valor Points. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c8">Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear for Arcane Mage DPS in Phase 4</span></h2>There's some changes to how stats work in cataclysm and a new stat as well, because of this your priorities change a bit as well, but because of reforging it makes it easier to pick and choose how much of each stat you want. You'll want to use a mix of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71881/brilliant-queens-garnet">
<img alt="Brilliant Queen's Garnet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicgem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Queen's Garnet</span></a> for red socket and items with bad socket bonuses, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71854/artful-lava-coral">
<img alt="Artful Lava Coral" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicgem_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Artful Lava Coral</span></a> for yellow sockets, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71864/veiled-shadow-spinel">
<img alt="Veiled Shadow Spinel" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicgem_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veiled Shadow Spinel</span></a> on blue sockets to help reach hit cap.<br/>
<br/>These gems might also be very expensive at the moment or your item is just not up to par with what's listed, in that case make use of the budget rare gem options, the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52207/brilliant-inferno-ruby">
<img alt="Brilliant Inferno Ruby" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior6.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Inferno Ruby</span></a>, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52239/potent-ember-topaz">
<img alt="Potent Ember Topaz" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior4.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Potent Ember Topaz</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52217/veiled-demonseye">
<img alt="Veiled Demonseye" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veiled Demonseye</span></a>
<br/>
<br/>Once you've hit the 17% hit cap, you'll aim for your soft haste cap, this is the amount of haste required to cast <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=30451/arcane-blast">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_arcane_blast.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcane Blast</span></a> in 1 sec during the initial burn phase. You can find the required haste caps in the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-stat-priority-attributes-pve#gearing-advice">Stat Priority Guide</a>.<br/>
<br/>After you've hit the required haste cap, you'll mostly try to get mastery as that increases the damage of your conservation phase significantly as well as your initial burst during burn phase. Critical strike rating is worse than the two previous stats but in some cases it makes sense to keep it.<br/>
<br/>This is a very straight forward specialization to pick items for, as well as to gem and reforge if you follow those advice.<br/>
<br/>
