<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4 Pre-Raid</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head">Head for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4 Pre-Raid</h4>The goal of this pre-raid gearing this phase is to obtain the four-piece tier 13 set as soon as possible through the heroic protocol twilight dungeons.<br/>Due to this, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78796/time-lords-hood">
<img alt="Time Lord's Hood" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Time Lord's Hood</span></a> is the obvious best in slot, both because of the previously mentioned reason, but also the fact it's the highest item level item available to us before raid.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
