<img alt="Nanoprecise Cape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_deathwingraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nanoprecise Cape</span></a>, this is the best in slot item for this phase for all mage specs so I recommend getting this week 1 or as soon as possible instead.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
