<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs">Legs for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4 Pre-Raid</h4>With this slot we use an off-piece instead of a tier 13 item, specifically, the tailoring <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71980/lavaquake-legwraps">
<img alt="Lavaquake Legwraps" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lavaquake Legwraps</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>If the tailoring legs are out of your budget, you can instead use the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78815/time-lords-leggings">
