<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4 Pre-Raid</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck">Neck for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4 Pre-Raid</h4>The only option that makes sense for the neck slot is the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71213/amulet-of-burning-brilliance">
<img alt="Amulet of Burning Brilliance" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amulet of Burning Brilliance</span></a>.<br/>Partially because it's so easy to obtain via the justice vendor, and because there's no new dragonsoul neck, meaning there's no LFR item in this slot to drop down to the new heroic dungeons.<div class="pad"></div>
