<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings">Rings for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4 Pre-Raid</h4>To LFR version of the two best in slot rings are the pre-raid best in slot rings, namely the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78427/ring-of-the-riven">
<img alt="Ring of the Riven" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_102.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Riven</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78495/infinite-loop">
<img alt="Infinite Loop" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_88.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Infinite Loop</span></a>.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>BiS Ring Enchant</b>: If you are an <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif");'>Enchanter</span>- use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74217/enchant-ring-intellect">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Intellect</span></a>. This profession isn't recommended.</div></div>
