<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4 Pre-Raid</h4>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77975/will-of-unbinding">
<img alt="Will of Unbinding" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonetablet_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Will of Unbinding</span></a> is clear pre-raid best in slot, it's even better than last phase base in slot.<br/>
<br/>For the second trinket, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60233/shard-of-woe">
<img alt="Shard of Woe" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_frost_iceshard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shard of Woe</span></a> can be the best option, but it's mostly good in longer fights which are a theme in most of dragonsoul at the start of the phase before the percentage damage buffs.<br/>If instead you're gearing towards the middle or end of the phase, don't even bother and instead go for the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77980/cunning-of-the-cruel">
<img alt="Cunning of the Cruel" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_coin_09.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cunning of the Cruel</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
